# ============================================================================
# Marshland — Git 排除项
# 目标平台为 Ubuntu ARM，开发在 Windows + WSL 下进行
# ============================================================================

# ---- CMake / CLion 构建产物 -------------------------------------------------
cmake-build-*/
build/
build-*/
out/
CMakeCache.txt
CMakeFiles/
CMakeUserPresets.json
cmake_install.cmake
compile_commands.json
CTestTestfile.cmake
Testing/
install_manifest.txt

# ---- 编译产物 ---------------------------------------------------------------
*.o
*.obj
*.a
*.lib
*.so
*.so.*
*.dylib
*.dll
*.exe
*.d
*.dwo
*.gcda
*.gcno
*.gcov

# ---- IDE / 编辑器（含本地工具链与 profile 配置，不共享） ---------------------
.idea/
.vscode/
.cache/
*.iml
*.swp
*~

# ---- 运行时产物（见 Design/Config.md 第 13、16 章） -------------------------
# 运行期配置由程序加载并写回，属机器本地状态，不入库
Config/dart_control.json
Logs/

# ---- 操作系统文件 -----------------------------------------------------------
Thumbs.db
Desktop.ini
.DS_Store

# ---- 临时与备份文件 ---------------------------------------------------------
*.tmp
*.bak
*.orig
*.rej
